'''Combat''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 1]] or through trading.
== Appearance ==
It’s blade and guard use a dull silver coloring, and seen primarily on the blade are minor cracks and scratches. The handle is a dark violet color and uses a tape-like texture.

== Trivia ==
* Combat is the prime of [[Combat II]].
* This is one of the few knives added alongside the [[Season 1]] update.

